We can use three-pointers.


ListNode* reverseList(ListNode* head) {
        ListNode* prev=NULL;
        ListNode* curr=head;
        ListNode* nex;
        while(curr!=NULL){
            nex=curr->next;
            curr->next=prev;
            prev=curr;
            curr=nex;
        }
        head=prev;
        return head;
    }

   The above Algorithm works in $\Theta (n)$ time in worst case.


   So, the answer is A.
